                    {
                        "form_id": "18933646-dba9-44be-9877-b1ac073a5771",
                        "entry_id": "08f32ef8-8631-396f-84b8-900f5a83e5d9",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "overshared"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0757a709-fc32-3a85-ac8d-6130f96ede5d",
                        "entry_id": "08f32ef8-8631-396f-84b8-900f5a83e5d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To share too much or in excess."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "71fc0b46-eaa7-3d05-b3ac-eeabbaf6d724",
                        "entry_id": "08f32ef8-8631-396f-84b8-900f5a83e5d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To offer inappropriate disclosure concerning one's personal life to others, now especially on social media."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c91579e-5adf-43e7-8004-f08bb0e5cb0f",
                                "sense_id": "71fc0b46-eaa7-3d05-b3ac-eeabbaf6d724",
                                "text": "\"I've been told by certain people that I have a tendency to overshare with strangers. I hope I haven't bored you with the details of my life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5801d224-a7a4-4804-9b83-3ca9cdfa00ea",
                                "sense_id": "71fc0b46-eaa7-3d05-b3ac-eeabbaf6d724",
                                "text": "To be clear, I love Twitter. It is the culture of oversharing and status anxiety that disturbs me. And that is inseparable from the grip of social media."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27dec297-779e-4020-967b-74e4fb547cd0",
                                "sense_id": "71fc0b46-eaa7-3d05-b3ac-eeabbaf6d724",
                                "text": "More often than not, the person does know the “offending” parent and has been pushed to the edge. If a submitter says, “This person never usually overshares,” I’ll take that into consideration and might not run the submission. But most of the time, that’s not the case. Once a poop picture oversharer, always a poop picture oversharer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "838ab255-4e70-4b7f-8056-d7f3372b2007",
                                "sense_id": "71fc0b46-eaa7-3d05-b3ac-eeabbaf6d724",
                                "text": "I’ve overshared about my mother in print. Let me briefly reshare. It’s complicated."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "009c10f1-98b6-4046-806b-c86896d50b00",
                                "sense_id": "71fc0b46-eaa7-3d05-b3ac-eeabbaf6d724",
                                "text": "Most parents do not overshare online because they are malicious; they simply have not fully considered the significance of their child’s digital footprint."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60628fb1-04be-46ae-9f8b-a234e287aa17",
                        "source_entry_id": "08f32ef8-8631-396f-84b8-900f5a83e5d9",
                        "source_sense_description": "to offer inappropriate disclosure",
                        "target_lang_word": "ausplaudern",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ausplaudern",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "691ad468-81b2-3bb3-a97c-b884aa4935d8",
                                        "entry_id": "93213741-84e0-3dc5-a8ca-8bcef61bac72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein Geheimnis weitererzählen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72f9ce40-241a-4288-80e9-1183a7f28f5c",
                                                "sense_id": "691ad468-81b2-3bb3-a97c-b884aa4935d8",
                                                "text": "„Schweigen war den meisten Menschen so unangenehm, dass sie zu reden begannen und dabei versehentlich die Gedanken ausplauderten, die sie eigentlich am stärksten verbergen wollten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "778eea26-cd69-42be-8165-d097514e194b",
                                                "sense_id": "691ad468-81b2-3bb3-a97c-b884aa4935d8",
                                                "text": "„Sie wollte generell nicht, dass andere Leute zu viel über sie wissen und ihre Geheimnisse womöglich noch ausplauderten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3ef6bf7-50de-4330-a306-a5dd9bb6fd6c",
                                                "sense_id": "691ad468-81b2-3bb3-a97c-b884aa4935d8",
                                                "text": "„Da Sie so liebenswürdig zu mir waren und um der alten Zeiten willen werde ich natürlich nichts ausplaudern.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be67f9cb-8c1e-339c-badd-a8604f2fbce7",
                                        "entry_id": "93213741-84e0-3dc5-a8ca-8bcef61bac72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "lang und ausgiebig miteinander reden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "reflexive",
                                            "regional"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "837be45d-e8a2-43f6-910e-d4fd02c6473e",
                                                "sense_id": "be67f9cb-8c1e-339c-badd-a8604f2fbce7",
                                                "text": "Lassen wir die jungen Mädchen auch sich mit einander ausplaudern.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
